			"notes": "# Beta 4 Changelog\n - Limit ice spell range to 32 blocks and reduce lag when updating with larger ranges #612\n - Improved performance of the hydrophobic spell\n - Zap apples now ripen faster\n - Bed sheet conversion recipes are now shaped recipes\n \n# Bugs Fixed\n - Fixed a lot of recipe's unlock advancement triggers not firing\n - Fixed spell recipes not crafting with the intended amounts of traits. #586\n - Fixed recipes including/duplicating the input item's traits when crafting\n - Fixed zap apple tree phases and fix zap apples popping off the trees when they change state\n - Fixed spell position not being synced correctly to the ether (fixes hydrophobic spell breaking when moving around)\n - Fixed transformations becoming permanent upon death/changing dimensions. #606\n - Fixed crash trying to initialise entities with Sabel's fast entity collisions hack enabled\n - Fixed palm trees decaying by themselves\n - Fixed oats crashing the game when playing through connector and using Forge\n - Fixed detection of connector when choosing which version of mixins to apply\n - Fixed palm trees decaying when they're not supposed to\n\n# Compatibility\n - Fixed crash on Neoforge due to PacketPayloadAcceptor not implementing the Consumer interface"
		},
